*.parquet
# Ignore the M5 cache directory's contents (the full opt-in dataset and the raw
# competition CSVs in data/m5/raw/ are large and never committed), but re-include
# the curated artifacts that ship with the app: the Bullet 15
# synthetic chassis sample, the Bullet 16 real-archetype parquets, and their
# provenance manifest. The negations work because we exclude the directory's
# contents (data/m5/*) rather than the directory itself; data/m5/raw/ is a
# sub-directory that stays excluded (no negation re-includes it).
data/m5/*
!data/m5/sample_smooth.parquet
!data/m5/archetype_*.parquet
!data/m5/archetypes_manifest.json
